
# --- GOLDEN TEST FIXTURE (2026-09-13) ---
# resetMode=loadvm: reset the guest between tests with QMP 'loadvm golden'.
# Fixture = Minix 2.0.4 logged in as root (no password) at the '#' shell with
#   Minix minix 2 0.4 i686
#   LICENSE  boot  etc  inet  lib  tmp
#   Makefile commands fs kernel mm tools
# on screen — i.e. `uname -a; ls /usr/src`. The source tree IS this exhibit.
# Text console, no pointer surface (SH_POINTER=none).
# Golden baked on the sandbox rig /data/vms/sandbox/minix2/smoke/rig.sh with the
# SAME device set as this launcher (CHS 200/16/32, -m 32, -smp 1, -vga std, no NIC).
#   restore proof : f10-restore.png (loadvm golden wiped a typed line, fixture back)
#   keyboard proof: f09-keyproof.png (echo line round-tripped, no dropped chars)
# Keyboard pacing: fleet floor 40/40 — no drops measured at that rate.
# AUDIO: PC speaker only (Minix console bell); no sound card in the guest.
SH_RESET_MODE=loadvm
SH_GOLDEN_SNAPSHOT=golden
SH_FIXTURE_DESC=minix2-root-shell-usr-src
